<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Bordertown, in what is now <a href="/countries/australia">Australia</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sydney">Sydney</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/australia">Australia</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=-36.3,140.77&amp;year=1987" aria-label="Bordertown on the atlas"><svg class="map map-globe map-loc" viewBox="0 0 10000 10000" role="img" aria-label="Globe: the birthplace of Bob Hawke"><image href="/maps/globes/g150s30.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="10000"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M4366 5563h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M4366 5563h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=-36.3,140.77&amp;year=1987">What was here in 1987? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
